#NEXUS

[ prieto-márquez2006b_fig11: Hadrosauroid strict consensus, read by eye. Three polytomies: D9* (Bactrosaurus, Gilmoreosaurus and the rest), E1 (Telmatosaurus, Tanius and the rest) and Hadrosauridae (G11*, eight branches). HADROSAUROIDEA and HADROSAURIDAE label nodes A3 and G11* and are kept; the node letters and values are not encoded. 24 tips, 3 polytomies (3, 3, 8 children); 2 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 8 case (census 2, seed 20261251). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

